# AI Theatre Coach

An AI-powered rehearsal partner built with Python, Streamlit, and the OpenAI API that helps actors rehearse scenes, stay in character, and better understand their roles.

## Current Features

- AI-powered scene partner
- Character-aware dialogue
- Scene context prompting
- Prompt engineering for in-character responses
- Streamlit web interface
- OpenAI API integration
- Git version control

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- OpenAI API
- python-dotenv
- Git & GitHub

## Roadmap

- [ ] Persistent conversation memory
- [ ] Script upload and parsing
- [ ] Memorization mode
- [ ] Character exploration mode
- [ ] Acting coach feedback
- [ ] Improv mode
- [ ] Voice conversations
- [ ] Streaming AI responses
- [ ] Theatre-inspired UI
- [ ] Deploy online

## Why I Built This

This project is helping me learn practical AI engineering by building a real application from the ground up. Along the way, I'm gaining experience with prompt engineering, application state management, API integration, software architecture, and iterative development.
